- **PS1 (`conc optimized`):** $r = {{ps1_pa_mv_conc_optimized_r5}}$, $\rho = {{ps1_pa_mv_conc_optimized_rho}}$, Active Exact = {{ps1_pa_mv_conc_optimized_exact_act_pct}}%, Jaccard = {{ps1_pa_mv_conc_optimized_jaccard}}, Norm. L1 = {{ps1_pa_mv_conc_optimized_norm_l1}}%, Top-10 = {{ps1_pa_mv_conc_optimized_top10}}/10.
- **PS2 (`conc optimized`):** $r = {{ps2_pa_mv_conc_optimized_r5}}$, $\rho = {{ps2_pa_mv_conc_optimized_rho}}$, Active Exact = {{ps2_pa_mv_conc_optimized_exact_act_pct}}%, Jaccard = {{ps2_pa_mv_conc_optimized_jaccard}}, Norm. L1 = {{ps2_pa_mv_conc_optimized_norm_l1}}%, Top-10 = {{ps2_pa_mv_conc_optimized_top10}}/10.
- **PS3 (`conc optimized`):** $r = {{ps3_pa_mv_conc_optimized_r5}}$, $\rho = {{ps3_pa_mv_conc_optimized_rho}}$, Active Exact = {{ps3_pa_mv_conc_optimized_exact_act_pct}}%, Jaccard = {{ps3_pa_mv_conc_optimized_jaccard}}, Norm. L1 = {{ps3_pa_mv_conc_optimized_norm_l1}}%, Top-10 = {{ps3_pa_mv_conc_optimized_top10}}/10.
- **`not optimized` range (PS1–PS3):** $r = {{pa_not_opt_r_min}}$–${{pa_not_opt_r_max}}$.

### Matched-Pair Uniform Random Audits on E19 (`seed={{audit_seed}}`)
Complete 12-column per-read classifications for all {{c75_n}} sampled pairs are archived in `data/matched_pair_audit_5000.tsv.gz` (verified across all 6 confusion matrices, 24/24 cells exact):
- **Paired-end Bowtie2:** **{{bm_bt2_pct}}%** ({{bm_bt2_n}}/{{c75_n}}, identical under both-mapped and proper-pair concordant criteria; 95% CI: {{bm_bt2_ci}}%).
- **`edlib` $\ge 75\%$:** Cognate = **{{c75_cog_on_pct}}%** (vs. Bowtie2 concordance {{bm_c75_conc}}%); all-target = **{{c75_all_on_pct}}%** (vs. Bowtie2 concordance {{bm_a75_conc}}%).
- **`edlib` $\ge 80\%$:** Cognate = **{{c80_cog_on_pct}}%** (vs. Bowtie2 concordance {{bm_c80_conc}}%); all-target = **{{c80_all_on_pct}}%** (vs. Bowtie2 concordance {{bm_a80_conc}}%).
- **Indel recovery ($N={{ind_n}}$):** {{ind_rec_n}} recovered ({{ind_rec_pct}}%, 95% CI: {{ind_rec_ci}}%), {{ind_gaps_pct}}% with alignment gaps (median {{ind_med_bp}} bp, IQR {{ind_iqr_lo}}–{{ind_iqr_hi}} bp).

